{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mr5h411ylje","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"Run 13 warm start trusted a vacuous UNKNOWN program and never entered repair","summary":"SPEC IS INCOMPLETE: EWM run-13 ls20 warm start recalled the dev ceiling program WHOLE yet got 31 live divergences with repair_attempts=0 and synthesis_attempts=0, for two compounding reasons, both fixed in run 14 (bench/arc_agi3_zonoid/ewm/agent.py).\n\nReason 1 (vacuous trust): the recalled ceiling program renders every unmodelable cell UNKNOWN, and validate() SKIPS UNKNOWN cells, so it passed the fresh probe suite VACUOUSLY and was adopted whole. Fix: _orient now re-measures CHANGED-cells accuracy over the fresh probes (the non-vacuous metric partial adoption uses) before whole-adopting; a program that only passes vacuously is routed through the masked partial path or refused. Telemetry RunSummary.orient_revalidation={probes, pass_rate, adopted_as}.\n\nReason 2 (repair never engaged): the recalled program hard-codes is_win=False, so the planner never found a goal, _plan returned None, and the loop hit the reactive path every turn. _handle_divergence (which calls _repair) was ONLY reachable from the planned-EXECUTE expect_mismatch, which an unplannable program never reaches. Fix: the plan-empty loop branch now checks _live_diverged (did the last observed single-step transition mispredict the active program) and routes it into _handle_divergence -> REPAIR with the failing live transition.\n\nCompounding: an accepted repair of a recalled program now supersedes the KB note it came from (_orient_note_key threaded into write_program_revision(supersedes=)).\n\nNote the driver reports summary field divergences = reactive_turns, NOT expect_mismatch events -- this is why run 13 showed 31 divergences with 0 repairs. Live run 14 verified the fix: orient_revalidation={probes:5, pass_rate:1.0, adopted_as:whole}, repair_attempts 0->3, live_pass_rate 0.05->0.93; no level cleared because the 3 qwen-coding repair candidates all failed 0/19 (candidate quality, not repair engagement).","category":null,"tags":[],"created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-07-03T21:56:45.526Z","vec":[-0.07369552552700043,0.02230921760201454,0.015850884839892387,0.03991305083036423,0.03877457231283188,-0.09607578068971634,-0.0687834843993187,0.048762235790491104,-0.045257169753313065,0.02318655326962471,0.04468041658401489,-0.018670490011572838,0.039132025092840195,-0.03595361113548279,-0.03606729954481125,0.01459305640310049,-0.013068653643131256,0.026127617806196213,-0.07577475905418396,0.06438767164945602,-0.02230546809732914,0.055376142263412476,0.016600800678133965,0.040100112557411194,-0.01748020201921463,-0.023436296731233597,-0.060039449483156204,0.05017450824379921,-0.033689770847558975,-0.07929491251707077,-0.015753230080008507,0.1207633912563324,-0.06561823934316635,-0.00405916478484869,0.07826492935419083,0.07570648938417435,-0.08994121104478836,-0.035149164497852325,-0.0749480277299881,-0.03622803837060928,-0.006128520239144564,0.027485324069857597,-0.042820293456315994,-0.00005188965587876737,0.016759755089879036,-0.03693203255534172,-0.04235908016562462,-0.04136371985077858,-0.014828559942543507,-0.027150653302669525,-0.03439103439450264,0.021566173061728477,0.03459437936544418,0.045214392244815826,0.006827883888036013,0.07309480756521225,0.038297154009342194,0.03561907261610031,-0.02135092206299305,-0.061014555394649506,0.021451078355312347,-0.033408742398023605,-0.06479585915803909,-0.0912279337644577,-0.026836702600121498,0.03276662155985832,0.010561101138591766,-0.08619467914104462,0.07325798273086548,0.01066305860877037,-0.009819015860557556,0.02905559353530407,-0.028882671147584915,0.02063853107392788,0.051866382360458374,0.1120237484574318,0.002705936785787344,-0.012612259946763515,0.016449572518467903,-0.10371125489473343,-0.05519312620162964,-0.010741026140749454,-0.024055123329162598,-0.009442252106964588,0.051378943026065826,-0.02371904067695141,0.00691320747137